{"componentChunkName":"component---src-layouts-project-page-js","path":"/projects/frecibo","result":{"data":{"allAirtable":{"edges":[{"node":{"data":{"title":"Frecibo","slug":"frecibo","type":"Startup","description":"Frecibo was the first startup I got involved in. It is a platform, aimed at students allowing them to order home cooked food from to campus. The initiative was to provide students with cheaper and healthier food options as well as giving local and aspiring chefs the oppurtunity to get paid for cooking. I am responsible for the design and front-end development of the platform as well as the majority of marketing material. The site has been built on PHP, with styling in SASS.","tech":["gulp","illustrator","html","php","photoshop","sass","sketch"],"link":"https://frecibo.com","date":"2017-06-01","artwork":{"localFiles":[{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":0.7163323782234957,"src":"/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/a7715/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg","srcSet":"/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/8f7df/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg 250w,\n/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/0f3a1/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg 500w,\n/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/a7715/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg 1000w,\n/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/37d86/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg 1500w,\n/static/68f9e6538c6ce157b7712a87304ff1b9/50d6c/ULPv6oKp_SXug2dagBNZnigVQ0vgzyy_ldVdH2JUScA.jpg 1825w","sizes":"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px"}}},{"childImageSharp":{"fluid":{"base64":"data:image/jpeg;base64,","aspectRatio":1.404494382022472,"src":"/static/406965d6cd2f0ddea54d6cf170dbe0c0/a7715/ByyUmrBxVt-KgSL1MaOkOUHzRehMqa6O0l7UjX_HRX4.jpg","srcSet":"/static/406965d6cd2f0ddea54d6cf170dbe0c0/8f7df/ByyUmrBxVt-KgSL1MaOkOUHzRehMqa6O0l7UjX_HRX4.jpg 250w,\n/static/406965d6cd2f0ddea54d6cf170dbe0c0/0f3a1/ByyUmrBxVt-KgSL1MaOkOUHzRehMqa6